<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  ExportOptions for Developer ID direct distribution.
  Used by `xcodebuild -exportArchive` in release.sh.

  signingStyle=manual: 用本地 keychain 已有的 Developer ID Application cert
    + 在本机已安装的 Developer ID provisioning profile,**不走** cloud-managed
    cert 的 Apple 端 fetch 流程。
    原因:cloud-managed Developer ID cert 需要 Account Holder/Admin 权限,
    member 角色用户走 automatic 会被 Apple 拒(403 FORBIDDEN_ERROR)。

  signingCertificate: 不能写完整的 SHA / Common Name,Apple 文档要求用类型名。
    "Developer ID Application" 让 Xcode 在 keychain 中找匹配的 Developer ID
    Application cert,只要 team ID 对得上就能用。

  provisioningProfiles: 必须在本机已经安装 Developer ID profile,profile name
    跟这里写的一致。如果没有,先在 Apple Developer Portal 手动建一个:
    https://developer.apple.com/account/resources/profiles/add
      → Software → Developer ID
      → App ID = tech.xvanturing.Noticky
      → 选 Developer ID Application cert (T8F5T6HKG8)
      → 起名 "Noticky Developer ID" → 下载 → 双击安装。
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <key>method</key>
    <string>developer-id</string>
    <key>teamID</key>
    <string>T8F5T6HKG8</string>
    <key>signingStyle</key>
    <string>manual</string>
    <key>signingCertificate</key>
    <string>Developer ID Application</string>
    <key>provisioningProfiles</key>
    <dict>
        <key>tech.xvanturing.Noticky</key>
        <string>Noticky Developer ID</string>
    </dict>
</dict>
</plist>
